{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "claude",
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 1730,
      "height": 75.0,
      "text": "Lab 12: APIM brokers the request, not the user's document permissions",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 85,
      "width": 1730,
      "height": 105.0,
      "text": "Three different tokens: T1 = caller -> broker API; T2 = same user -> Search (OBO); T3 = APIM identity -> Search.\nRuntime retrieval flow below. Source lookup / knowledge-base creation still go directly from notebook to Search.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "caller",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 215,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 340,
      "strokeColor": "#0078D4",
      "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "caller-text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 235,
      "width": 270,
      "height": 332.5,
      "text": "Python notebook / Azure CLI\n\nSigned-in workshop user\nRequests broker API token\nUses broker client ID\nNo broker secret or Web IQ\nkey in retrieval requests",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "apim",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 215,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "strokeColor": "#5C2D91",
      "backgroundColor": "#E8DAEF",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "apim-text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 235,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 332.5,
      "text": "Existing APIM gateway: /iq\n\nValidate T1: tenant, audience, scope\nExchange T1 for T2 using broker app\nAdd Web IQ key from secret named value\nReplace Authorization with T3\nStrip elevated-read bypass header",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "search",
      "x": 1380,
      "y": 215,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 340,
      "strokeColor": "#107C10",
      "backgroundColor": "#DFF6DD",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "search-text",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 235,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 332.5,
      "text": "Azure AI Search\n\n<prefix>-apim-kb\nT3: authorize gateway\nT2: preserve user's context\nfor indexed SharePoint ACLs\nKey controls for Web IQ only",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "arrow",
      "id": "caller-apim",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 0,
      "points": [
        [
          0,
          0
        ],
        [
          230,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "strokeColor": "#0078D4",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "endArrowhead": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "caller-apim-label",
      "x": 365,
      "y": 285,
      "width": 210,
      "height": 135.0,
      "text": "2. Send T1\nAuthorization:\nBearer broker token",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "arrow",
      "id": "apim-search",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 0,
      "points": [
        [
          0,
          0
        ],
        [
          320,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "strokeColor": "#5C2D91",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "endArrowhead": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "apim-search-label",
      "x": 1075,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 135.0,
      "text": "4. Authorization = T3\nUser-context header = T2\nWeb IQ per-source key headers",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "entra",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 775,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 260,
      "strokeColor": "#5C2D91",
      "backgroundColor": "#E8DAEF",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "entra-text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 795,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 285.0,
      "text": "Microsoft Entra ID\n\nIssues T1 to Azure CLI for broker API\nOBO: T1 + broker ID + broker secret\n   -> T2 for Search, same user\nAPIM managed identity obtains T3",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
